0,Bodo-Gadaba - lingweb.eva.mpg.de,https://lingweb.eva.mpg.de/channumerals/Gadaba-Bodo.htm,"Bodo Gadaba still has two Munda numbers: 1 mujro and 2 umbar, the rest of the numbers are borrowed from Deisya / Oriya. ''Bodo'' means big in Oriya. Gadaba. Bodo Gadaba is spoken by approximately 8,000 speakers in Andhra Pradesh and Odisha states, India. Note that in Ollar Gadaba, the Dravidian variety is called San Gadaba means small Gadaba.","Gadaba, Bodo",Austro-Asiatic
